{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition","lp-空间","补充定义--definition-supplement"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Lebesgue Lp Spaces","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"lp-空间\"></a></p>\n<h1><span class=\"math inline\">L^p</span> 空间</h1>\n<p><a id=\"补充定义--definition-supplement\"></a></p>\n<h2>补充定义 / Definition supplement</h2>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>对测度空间 <span class=\"math inline\">(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)</span> 及 <span class=\"math inline\">1\\le p&lt;\\infty</span>，<span class=\"math inline\">L^p(X)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math inline\">\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty</span> 的可测函数按几乎处处相等（almost everywhere equality）取等价类所得的空间，范数为 <span class=\"math inline\">\\|f\\|_p=(\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu)^{1/p}</span>。<span class=\"math inline\">L^\\infty</span> 的范数是本质上确界（essential supremum）<span class=\"math inline\">\\|f\\|_\\infty=\\operatorname{ess\\,sup}|f|</span>。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>上确界</td>\n<td>supremum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>几乎处处</td>\n<td>almost everywhere</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可测</td>\n<td>measurability</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可测函数</td>\n<td>measurable function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本质上确界</td>\n<td>essential supremum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测度</td>\n<td>measure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范数</td>\n<td>norm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"ra.lp-spaces.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"ra.lp-spaces","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"Lebesgue 空间"}],"anchors":["definition","lp-空间","补充定义--definition-supplement"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition","lp-空间","补充定义--definition-supplement"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Lebesgue Lp Spaces","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"lp-空间\"></a></p>\n<h1><span class=\"math inline\">L^p</span> 空间</h1>\n<p><a id=\"补充定义--definition-supplement\"></a></p>\n<h2>补充定义 / Definition supplement</h2>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>对测度空间 <span class=\"math inline